flowchart TD
    UI[Next.js Dashboard] --> API[FastAPI Control API]
    API --> PG[(PostgreSQL operational state and audit)]
    API --> Q[Durable job queue]
    Q --> DW[Data Worker]
    Q --> RW[Research Worker]
    Q --> BW[Backtest Worker]
    DW --> RP[ResearchPacket and Signals]
    RW --> RP
    RP --> PC[Portfolio Constructor]
    PC --> RISK[Deterministic Risk Service]
    RISK --> PLAN[SignedOrderPlan]
    PLAN --> EXEC[Execution Service]
    EXEC --> PAPER[Paper Adapter]
    EXEC --> CCXT[CCXT Adapter]
    EXEC --> STOCK[Stock Adapter]
    PAPER --> REC[Reconciler]
    CCXT --> REC
    STOCK --> REC
    REC --> PG
    REC --> OBS[Metrics, Traces, Alerts]
